<description>&lt;p&gt;China has threatened to cut undersea cables that link Taiwan and the Philippines while expanding patrols near Taiwan, and the Philippine Coast Guard has probed a Chinese vessel carrying unidentified equipment inside Scarborough Shoal. The Coast Guard also rescued a ferry in Quezon waters, delivered fuel to fishermen at Scarborough Shoal, and assisted more than 150,000 sea travelers during the Undas period. Philippine officials have criticised China’s inconsistent stance on UNCLOS and the South China Sea. The conflict remains low-intensity, with 176 battle-related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQVTQzT3kxVmMtak9FMGI2bmhlVnFuUkpqUnZtWVE1SFRnaG93UVlOU3ZWQklTRDlqcTFJYTZOQXB1UnkxRHVOSDctN1ZJLTFxVElQeGtFaTRGcXJMZTQ1RGVIM2lXWWNxa3EzWTRNWS1FRWhjZ25BNUY3WnVmeFE3TEFLbi1OZzNQVEhOUFVPaDZ6ZlVaYV81NGVpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNQ3BJYnJXZWM3YVc5eVo4Y2xjRjNVa29lWW5KSExVTEhxY25YUk1PTFFwR3BBWVJTaF9iZUl4RXI0SnFYYlJoamUyN0c4b3Y5el9Eb0tucFZ1emwwdVdTVlYtOG1qb1RUeTBYVFUwelYteEVVM0s0YndablhkS2xIMmp1WlljN0FKalI0RURKb2xqWUNXWm5oZE5pUlJDR2d1eHQ4?oc=5&quot;&gt;New York Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE1Rc2Mtd1FPazlTVTgwbFZQYTFFZEc2QlMwRTVuaGFjNjAwWDEwYUlBSVhWS0ZPQmdQS2dEVW1kTVNvcU42VjBnNm02VS0tLWxFRGZrRkRNU3lFNG9CUzlmVjFEZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NHKニュース&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOeHBuZXRKMVZlSi1ldXVtVWp0ekI4Yi13Wk9xMjBOSC02OURfTExUSXJEbXFCOFU1emQ3UExjQ1FLLUdtUnM2YjVKc0RMQTFRTWxMbV9qR09zN1BIdmh0NElvVnBKaGl2NEFZRmNsc1M3OF9ueXdoejNQMXZud2NOSG9fTnN3c0psMmNCRkFDaXhRenF5ZmVHRi0xS2toWThRS0R5WC1LZjNzbkNiZEVLWHhCVk11X0dtM29wZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt